"foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"புன்மை","tr":"puṉmai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புன்","tr":"puṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"}]},{"text":"நாம்","tr":"nām","foot":"nāḷ","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாம்","tr":"nām"}]},{"text":"உயற்கே","tr":"uyaṟkē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உயற்","tr":"uyaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பூவிடை","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"interval"}],"gloss":"the space between flowers"},{"surface":"படினும்","parts":[{"text":"படினும்","lemma":"படு","gloss":"even if resting"}],"gloss":"even if falling between"},{"surface":"யாண்டு","parts":[{"text":"யாண்டு","lemma":"யாண்டு","gloss":"year"}],"gloss":"a year"},{"surface":"கழிந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"கழிந்தன்ன","lemma":"கழிந்தன்ன","gloss":"like having passed"}],"gloss":"like having passed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீருறை","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"dwelling"}],"gloss":"water-dwelling"},{"surface":"மகன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"மகன்றில்","lemma":"மகன்றில்","gloss":"makanril bird"}],"gloss":"makanril bird"},{"surface":"புணர்ச்சி","parts":[{"text":"புணர்ச்சி","lemma":"புணர்ச்சி","gloss":"union"}],"gloss":"union"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிரிவரிதாகிய","parts":[{"text":"பிரிவு","lemma":"பிரிவு","gloss":"separation"},{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"அரிது","gloss":"difficult"},{"text":"ஆகிய","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"which became"}],"gloss":"which is difficult to separate"},{"surface":"தண்டா","parts":[{"text":"தண்டா","lemma":"தண்டா","gloss":"unceasing"}],"gloss":"unceasing"},{"surface":"காமமொடு","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with love"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உடனுயிர்","parts":[{"text":"உடனுயிர்","lemma":"உடனுயிர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போகுக","parts":[{"text":"போகுக","lemma":"போகுக","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தில்ல","parts":[{"text":"தில்ல","lemma":"தில்ல","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கடனறிந்","parts":[{"text":"கடனறிந்","lemma":"கடனறிந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"திருவேம்","parts":[{"text":"திருவேம்","lemma":"திருவேம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆகிய","parts":[{"text":"ஆகிய","lemma":"ஆகிய","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வுலகத்","parts":[{"text":"வுலகத்","lemma":"வுலகத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தொருவே","parts":[{"text":"தொருவே","lemma":"தொருவே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாகிய","parts":[{"text":"மாகிய","lemma":"மாகிய","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புன்மை","parts":[{"text":"புன்மை","lemma":"புன்மை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாம்","parts":[{"text":"நாம்","lemma":"நாம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உயற்கே","parts":[{"text":"உயற்கே","lemma":"உயற்கே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Even if a flower comes between them, as if a year has passed / like the union of the water-dwelling makanril birds / with unceasing love that is difficult to separate / may our lives depart together, so that, knowing our duty / in this world where we were once two / we may escape the misery of becoming solitary.","translation":"Even if a single flower comes between them, it feels as if a whole year has passed—such is the union of the water-dwelling makanril birds. With an unceasing love that is just as inseparable, may our lives depart together! Thus, we, who know our duty, shall escape the misery of being left alone in this world where we once lived as two.","modern":"பூக்களுக்கு நடுவே இடைவெளி ஏற்பட்டாலும் ஒரு வருடம் கழிந்தது போல வருந்தும் நீரில் வாழும் அன்றில் பறவைகளின் சேர்க்கையைப் போல, பிரிப்பதற்கு அரிய வற்றாத காதலுடன் எங்களது உயிர்கள் ஒன்றாகவே போகட்டும். கடமையை உணர்ந்த நாம் இருவரும் ஒன்றாக வாழ்ந்த இவ்வுலகில், தனித்து வாழும் துன்பத்திலிருந்து தப்பிப்பதற்காக இதுவே வழி.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her companion about her deep, inseparable love for her hero. She compares their bond to that of the makanril birds, which live in water-bodies and are famous for their absolute devotion; even if a single flower drifts between them during their embrace, they feel the pain of a year-long separation. She wishes that their lives would depart at the very same moment rather than one having to survive the other. This poem belongs to the neytal tiṇai (seashore landscape), which deals with the themes of pining and the dread of separation. Key words include makanril (the inseparable bird), puṇarcci (union), and uṭaṉuyir pōkuka (may our lives depart together).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}